# ==============================================================================
# NAME: Discord Complete Ecosystem Rule-Set (Discord.list)
# DESCRIPTION: Covers Discord Core, Voice/Media RTC Servers, CDN & Attachments,
#              Game SDKs, Bot Webhooks, Telemetry/Analytics & Official ASNs.
# UPDATED: 2026-10
# USAGE IN SURGE (Surge.conf):
#   RULE-SET,Discord.list,Discord,extended-matching
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Domain Suffixes (品牌专属、核心服务、CDN 与周边服务域名后缀)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
